  "reactor cooling water inlet temperature/valve fault (cooling-water loop disturbance, XMV_3/XMEAS_1 pairing)",
  "condenser cooling-water flow/valve degradation (XMV_11/XMEAS_17 or XMV_7/XMEAS_12 loop fouling or sticking)",
  "stripper/separator level or feed disturbance propagating through recycle (XMEAS_9 pressure swing) "
